    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[0].dialogText
      value: "Dr Ezreal, chuy\u1EC7n g\xEC \u0111ang x\u1EA3y ra v\u1EADy. C\u0103n
        c\u1EE9 tr\xF4ng th\u1EADt h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[1].dialogText
      value: "Nova, anh \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc r\u1ED3i. Th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi
        \u0111ang tr\xEAn b\u1EDD v\u1EF1c s\u1EE5p \u0111\u1ED5 "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[2].dialogText
      value: "Oblivion \u0111\xE3 chi\u1EBFm gi\u1EEF ba vi\xEAn ng\u1ECDc Eden Relics.
        Ch\xFAng \u0111ang thao t\xFAng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a thi\xEAn nhi\xEAn
        theo \xFD mu\u1ED1n c\u1EE7a m\xECnh"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[3].dialogText
      value: "C\xE1c th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 l\u1EDBn \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB nh\u1EA5n ch\xECm
        trong bi\u1EC3n l\u1EEDa v\xE0 b\xE3o t\u1ED1. Nh\u1EEFng khu r\u1EEBng xanh
        gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE2y ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n l\xE0 \u0111\u1ED1ng tro t\xE0n. Tr\xE1i
        \u0110\xE1t \u0111ang d\u1EA7n m\u1EA5t \u0111i s\u1EF1 s\u1ED1ng"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[4].dialogText
      value: "N\u1EBFu ch\xFAng ta kh\xF4ng h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng ngay b\xE2y gi\u1EDD,
        ch\u1EC9 trong v\xE0i ng\xE0y n\u1EEFa Oblivion s\u1EBD ho\xE0n to\xE0n ki\u1EC3m
        so\xE1t th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi n\xE0y. L\xFAc \u0111\xF3, lo\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
        kh\xF4ng c\xF2n c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[5].dialogText
      value: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 n\xE0o, ch\xFAng ta c\xF3 c\xE1ch n\xE0o \u0111\u1EC3
        ng\u0103n ch\u1EB7n ch\xFAng kh\xF4ng"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[6].dialogText
      value: "C\xF3 m\u1ED9t hy v\u1ECDng duy nh\u1EA5t. Eden Relics, Nh\u1EEFng
        c\u1ED5 v\u1EADt  ch\u1EE9a \u0111\u1EF1ng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1ED5 \u0111\u1EA1i.
        Th\u1EE9 duy nh\u1EA5t c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED1i ch\u1ECDi v\u1EDBi s\u1EE9c
        m\u1EA1nh Oblivion"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[7].dialogText
      value: "Eden Relics! t\xF4i ch\u01B0a t\u1EEBng nghe v\u1EC1 ch\xFAng"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[8].dialogText
      value: "Ch\xFAng \u0111ang b\u1ECB qu\xE1i v\u1EADt n\u1EAFm gi\u1EEF. Nh\u01B0ng
        theo nh\u1EEFng t\xE0i li\u1EC7u c\u1ED5 m\xE0 t\xF4i t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c,
        vi\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn do qu\xE1i v\u1EADt Slime chi\u1EBFm gi\u1EEF
        ."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[9].dialogText
      value: "V\u1EADy t\xF4i s\u1EBD l\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ngay!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2210206556098237478, guid: 2cf86c9f64ed9a3439fcbca8df60e375, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogEntries.Array.data[0].speakerName
